# 统一行尾纪律（2026-11-09）
#
# 为什么：宿主 parseSkillMd 等解析器按 \n 切分 frontmatter，Windows 机器上
# core.autocrlf=true 会把 checkout 变成 CRLF —— 插件装上了但技能列表空。
# 这里显式钉死 LF，让任何平台检出的结果一致；二进制显式标 binary，
# 避免被当成文本做行尾转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary

*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.node binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary

*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
